\f1 \cf2 ). Notice what does not \'97 the arm, the terror, the 
\f2 \cf2 \uc0\u1492 \u1464 \u1502 \u1493 \u1465 \u1503 
\f1 \cf2 . So the death of a nation is the stripping of operative agency and its reduction to a remembered, shamed identity lying among peers. The corporate person persists as an object; it ceases as a subject. This is a precise category, and it is the one your whole project has been circling: an entity can "die" in Ezekiel's sense by losing the capacity to act and to be trusted, while its substrate and even its name endure. That is a death an AI could die.\

